<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13258" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπομύσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπό-ττω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wipe</i> the nose, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥῖνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					11.268
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σεαυτόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>Epict.</u>
					1.6.30
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i>blow one's nose,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				910
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				1.2.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Char.</u>
				19.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.134
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδατώδη ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					897a31
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βραχίονι, ἀγκῶνιἀ.,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.631d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				4.46
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>stop</i> his <i>drivel,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				343a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be wiped clean,</i> i.e. <i>cheated,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γέρων ἀπεμέμυκτ᾽ ἄθλιος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					493
				</span></i>
			 (
				Act.
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>snuff</i> a wick, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
				847
			</span></i>. (Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυκτήρ, μύξα,</span> Lat.
				<i>mūcus, emungo.</i>)</div>
